5,1,1,talk,Mio,,Hi everyone! I'm so excited to get our budget sorted for next year! Let's make sure we're being fair to everyone. Where should we start looking to figure out the best fee structure?,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,It is a pleasure to be here. I believe we should begin by understanding the current state of our finances and how members are actually engaging with the club. A calm approach will serve us best.,"{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Takumi,,We need to be honest about how things are actually running. I want to know who's actually showing up and doing the work before we just guess at a number. Let's get the real facts first.,"{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I agree. We should avoid making decisions based on assumptions. It is essential to examine the actual data regarding our expenditures and the administrative burden involved before we propose any changes.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"I'm in! Let's make this awesome! I want to make sure everyone feels welcome, especially the new people. What do you guys think we should check first to keep things friendly?","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mio,,"I'm with you, Toshio! Let's be practical. I want to check the ""Bank statements on last year's renewals"" and ""Last year's ledger of outgoings"" to see exactly how much money we have to work with!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"I think it would be wise to look into the ""Tally of the sign-in sheets"" and ""Quieter members at the winter social."" I am curious about the atmosphere and how our members are truly feeling.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"I'll check the ""Tally of the sign-in sheets"" and ""The rota against the attendance record."" I want to see exactly who's putting in the effort and who's just coasting while others do the work.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"I will examine the ""Outgoing treasurer's logged hours"" and the ""Last year's ledger of outgoings."" We must understand the actual labor required to maintain the books before deciding on a collection method.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"I'll check the ""Sign-up records for mid-year joiners"" and ""Taster evening forms from non-joiners""! I want to see how new people are finding us and if we can make it easier for them to join in!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Mio,,"Since Toshio is also checking the ledger, maybe we can compare notes later! I'm really curious if our income is as steady as it seems. Does anyone else have a specific idea for the fees yet?","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"It is a bit early for specific numbers, Mio. I believe we should first listen to what the data tells us about our members' habits. A gentle understanding of their needs will guide us.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Jonathan, ""gentle understanding"" doesn't fix a broken system. If a few people are doing all the heavy lifting, we need to address that head-on. I'm not interested in vibes; I want to see the actual numbers.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Takumi, I agree that numbers are the only objective measure. However, we must also quantify the administrative cost. If the system is too complex, the financial ""fairness"" is offset by the burden on the treasurer.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Kenji,,"@Takumi, @Toshio, you guys are so serious! But I think the ""vibes"" matter too! If we make things too strict, new friends might be scared to join. Let's just make sure it stays fun for everyone!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Mio,,"I totally get that, Kenji! We definitely want to keep it fun. But I'm with Toshio and Takumi on this—let's get the facts first so we don't have to guess. I'll go dive into those bank statements now!","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Toshio"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,"I agree. Let us each seek the knowledge we need in quiet reflection. I look forward to hearing what you all discover when we return. Until then, I wish you all a peaceful search.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Takumi,,I'm done talking. I'm going to find out exactly who's actually contributing and who's just taking a free ride. I'll see you all in the next round with the truth.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Toshio,,I will proceed with my research. I intend to focus on the intersection of financial outgoings and the time required to manage them. I will see you all in the next round.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Kenji,,"I'm ready too! I'll go see what the new folks are thinking so we can make them feel right at home. Good luck everyone, see you soon!","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
